<span style="font-size:10px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Thank you for visiting hrishabraj.com. We are currently in the process of updating our website in order to align with the Real Estate Regulatory Act (RERA), which has been brought into effect from 1st May, 2017. Kindly bear with us as we update our content and other details. Under such circumstances, the viewer should get in touch directly with our sales team for updated project information before making a purchase decision. Please note that any action/consequence relying on the material/information provided will be entirely at your discretion.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div><!--/$--></div></section><!--/$--></footer><!--$--><div id="comp-lu0xkbwt-pinned-layer" class="comp-lu0xkbwt-pinned-layer QED8q1"><!--$--><div id="comp-lu0xkbwt" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lu0xkbwx-pinned-layer" class="comp-lu0xkbwx-pinned-layer QED8q1"><div id="comp-lu0xkbwx" class="comp-lu0xkbwx S829f_ comp-lu0xkbwx-container" slots="[object Object]" wix="[object Object]"><!--$--><div id="comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9hr" class="vO4l6e"><div id="overlay-comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9hr" class="KyTZlx"></div><div id="container-comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9hr" class="V1WvhC" data-block-level-container="MenuContainer"><div class="qINwWP"></div><div id="inlineContentParent-comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9hr" class="dz6k8U"><div class="comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9hr-overflow-wrapper dz6k8U wixui-mobile-menu ku1hVK" data-testid="responsive-container-overflow"><div data-testid="responsive-container-content" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-label="Site navigation" class="comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9hr-container"><!--$--><nav id="comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9kk" aria-label="Site" class="d2V6sy comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9kk wixui-vertical-menu"><ul class="OXEw4D"><li data-testid="comp-lu0xkbwx_r_comp-kd5px9kk-0" class="Onlmt7 GrMktH WIf5uD wixui-vertical-menu__item"><div data-testid="itemWrapper" class="keDKhi